          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What should I do if my order arrives damaged or incorrect?",
            "answer": "<p>Contact our customer support team within <strong>[24/48] hours</strong> of receiving the parcel. Share your order number along with clear photos or an unboxing video so the issue can be reviewed promptly.</p>",
